#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:2
msgid "How to embed content from your documentation"
msgstr "如何嵌入文档内容"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs allows you to embed content from any of the projects we host "
"and specific allowed external domains (currently, ``docs.python.org``, "
"``docs.scipy.org``, ``docs.sympy.org``, ``numpy.org``) This allows reuse of "
"content across sites, making sure the content is always up to date."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 允许你嵌入我们托管的任何项目以及特定允许的外部域（目前为 ``docs.python.org`` "
"、``docs.scipy.org`` 、``docs.sympy.org`` 、``numpy.org`` "
"）的内容。这支持跨站点复用内容，确保内容始终是最新的。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:8
msgid ""
"There are a number of use cases for embedding content, so we've built our "
"integration in a way that enables users to build on top of it. This guide "
"will show you some of our favorite integrations:"
msgstr "嵌入内容有多种使用场景，因此我们以便于用户在其基础上构建的方式设计了集成。本指南将介绍我们精选的一些集成："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:16
msgid "Contextualized tooltips on documentation pages"
msgstr "文档页面上的上下文提示"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:18
msgid ""
"Tooltips on your own documentation are really useful to add more context to "
"the current page the user is reading. You can embed any content that is "
"available via an HTML id."
msgstr "在自有文档上加提示浮层，能为用户正在阅读的当前页补充更多上下文。你可以嵌入任何可通过 HTML id 获取的内容。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:21
msgid ""
"We built an addon called :doc:`Link previews </link-previews>` on top of our"
" Embed API that you can enable from the addons settings of your project "
"using the :term:`dashboard`."
msgstr ""
"我们在 Embed API 之上构建了名为 :doc:`Link previews </link-previews>` 的 addon，可通过 "
":term:`dashboard` 在项目 addon 设置中启用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:25
msgid "Inline help on application website"
msgstr "应用网站上的内联帮助"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:27
msgid ""
"This allows us to keep the official documentation as the single source of "
"truth, while having great inline help in our application website as well. On"
" the \"Automation Rules\" admin page we could embed the content of our :doc"
":`/automation-rules` documentation page and be sure it will be always up to "
"date."
msgstr ""
"这让我们既能把官方文档作为唯一事实来源，又能在应用网站上提供出色的内联帮助。在\"自动化规则\"管理页面上，我们可以嵌入 :doc"
":`/automation-rules` 文档页的内容，并确保其始终最新。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:34
msgid ""
"We recommend you point at tagged releases instead of latest. Tags don't "
"change over time, so you don't have to worry about the content you are "
"embedding disappearing."
msgstr "我们建议指向带标签的发布版本而非 latest。标签不会随时间变化，因此无需担心嵌入的内容消失。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:37
msgid ""
"The following example will fetch the section \"Creating an automation rule\""
" in page ``automation-rules.html`` from our own docs and will populate the "
"content of it into the ``#help-container`` div element."
msgstr ""
"以下示例将从我们的文档获取 ``automation-rules.html`` 页面中的\"Creating an automation "
"rule\"章节，并把内容填充到 ``#help-container`` div 元素中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:57
msgid ""
"You can modify this example to subscribe to ``.onclick`` Javascript event, "
"and show a modal when the user clicks in a \"Help\" link."
msgstr "你可修改此示例以订阅 ``.onclick`` Javascript 事件，在用户点击\"Help\"链接时显示模态框。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:62
msgid ""
"Take into account that if the title changes, your ``section`` argument will "
"break. To avoid that, you can manually define Sphinx references above the "
"sections you don't want to break. For example,"
msgstr "请注意，若标题变更，你的 ``section`` 参数会失效。为避免这种情况，可在不希望失效的章节上方手动定义 Sphinx 引用。例如，"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:68
msgid "reStructuredText"
msgstr "reStructuredText"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:82
msgid "MyST (Markdown)"
msgstr "MyST（Markdown）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:94
msgid ""
"To link to the section \"Creating an automation rule\" you can send "
"``section=unbreakable-section-reference``. If you change the title it won't "
"break the embedded content because the label for that title will still be "
"``unbreakable-section-reference``."
msgstr ""
"要链接到\"Creating an automation rule\"章节，可发送 ``section=unbreakable-section-"
"reference`` 。即使修改标题，嵌入内容也不会失效，因为该标题的标签仍是 ``unbreakable-section-reference`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:97
msgid ""
"Please, take a look at the Sphinx `:ref:` `role documentation`_ for more "
"information about how to create references."
msgstr "有关如何创建引用，请查阅 Sphinx `:ref:` `role documentation`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:103
msgid "Calling the Embed API directly"
msgstr "直接调用 Embed API"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:105
msgid ""
"Embed API lives under ``https://app.readthedocs.org/api/v3/embed/`` URL and "
"accept the URL of the content you want to embed. Take a look at :ref:`its "
"own documentation <api/v3:embed>` to find out more details."
msgstr ""
"Embed API 位于 ``https://app.readthedocs.org/api/v3/embed/`` URL，接受你想嵌入内容的 "
"URL。更多细节请参阅 :ref:`其文档 <api/v3:embed>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/embedding-content.rst:108
msgid ""
"You can click on the following links and check a live response directly in "
"the browser as examples:"
msgstr "你可以点击以下链接，直接在浏览器中查看实时响应作为示例："

